# This repo holds the tool only. The workspace it builds lives elsewhere
# (setup.ps1 -Root <path>) and is personal: class folders, Canvas mirrors,
# snapshots and notes never belong in version control. The allowlist below is
# belt-and-braces in case someone runs the tool in place anyway.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!SKILL.md
!AGENTS.md
!CLAUDE.md
!GEMINI.md
!setup.ps1
!platform.ps1
!canvas-watch.ps1
!scaffold-class.ps1
!standup.ps1
!doctor.ps1
!templates/
!templates/**
!docs/
!docs/**
